WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:02.969
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:03.970
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:04.970
That's so good to hear.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:05.972
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.539
The Senate yesterday passed

00:00:07.539 --> 00:00:10.176
the trillion-dollar
bipartisan infrastructure bill.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.144
It's what Chris Cuomo is calling

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:15.481
absolutely the only news
right now.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.117
[ Laughter ]
That's right, the Senate
yesterday passed

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.653
the trillion-dollar
bipartisan infrastructure bill

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:23.723
and 19 Republican Senators voted
for the legislation,

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.058
including Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell,

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:27.226
which means that --

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:28.394
Oh, no.

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:29.562
Oh, what's wrong with it?

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.664
What did we do?!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:33.733
When asked, during a press
conference yesterday,

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.868
to assess New York
Governor Andrew Cuomo's

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.837
time in office,
President Biden said,

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.072
"He's done a hell of a job."

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:41.874
No offense, but I don't think

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.242
that's what they
were asking about.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:46.345
If someone asks your opinion
on what OJ Simpson did,

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:48.515
they don't mean
with the Buffalo Bills.

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:50.016
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:53.419
Former Education Secretary
Betsy DeVos announced yesterday

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.989
she will not run for governor
of Michigan next year.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:59.291
Well, actually,
she said president of Michigan,

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.293
but you get the idea.

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:03.463
The state of Oregon
today restored

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:05.097
its statewide mask mandate,

00:01:05.097 --> 00:01:07.834 line:0%
after receiving
this dire warning.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:11.371 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:14.273
A driver in Staten Island
this weekend crashed

00:01:14.273 --> 00:01:15.942
into the front
of a Dunkin' Donuts.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:19.345
Oh, man, that was like
their one nice restaurant.

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.546
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:22.048
Sorry, Colin.

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:23.283
Sorry, Pete.

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.251
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.254
And, finally, Pepsi announced
a new partnership yesterday

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.489
with the brewers
of Sam Adams beer

00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:32.826
to create an alcoholic version
of Mountain Dew

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:34.627
and, if that sounds good to you,

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.229
don't worry about what's
in the vaccine.

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:39.766
[ Laughter ]
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

